title: "QuadratNotes"
abstract: "Free, offline, open-source app for recording coastal quadrat surveys of seagrass, rocky shores and saltmarsh, with optional random point sampling and GPS guidance, backup and restore, and analysis-ready CSV, GeoJSON, KML and Darwin Core exports."
